{"id": 7486, "raw": "<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hitre povezave</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://cal.com/matteocigala/15min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rezerviraj klic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.vivifysports.com/nutritionalcoaching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Prehranski posvet z Marine</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/353834777697\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp Matteo</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.skool.com/cigala-cycling-collective-1115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Skupnost na Skoolu</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Skupnost na Skoolu je za športnike, ki jih treniram, brezplačna. Povabila še nimaš? <a href=\"mailto:matteo@cigalacycling.com?subject=Skool%20invitation\">Pošlji mi email</a> in ti ga pošljem (preveri tudi mapo z neželeno pošto, včasih pristane tam).</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tvoje aplikacije za trening</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tvoj načrt je v Vekti in se sinhronizira z Garminom, Wahoojem ali Zwiftom.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://app.joinvekta.com/me/calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Odpri moj koledar v Vekti</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Knjižnica za trening</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Moč in core</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7525,\"href\":\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7525\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7525\">Raztezanje in core</a><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7525\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7526,\"href\":\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7526\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7526\">Krožni trening v fitnesu: zima, prvi mesec</a><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7526\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7527,\"href\":\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7527\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7527\">Krožni trening v fitnesu: zima, drugi in tretji mesec</a><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7527\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7528,\"href\":\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7528\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7528\">Krožni trening v fitnesu: med sezono</a><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7528\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Video rutine</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5DQPV2sc_0WTgEJlbBZpJXFOjgDktpnz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rutina za core in moč</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5DQPV2sc_0VdvMQZYo-Qaxv6Ual0Fbm7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rutina raztezanja</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prehrana, z Marine Lenehan</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7529,\"href\":\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7529\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7529\">Prehranski vodnik</a><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7529\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7530,\"href\":\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7530\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7530\">Seznam prehranskih dopolnil</a><a href=\"https://staging.coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7530\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Orodja za trening</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"ath-tools\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons ath-tools\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/carbs-per-hour-calculator/\">Ogljikovi hidrati na uro</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/critical-power-calculator/\">Critical Power</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/sweat-rate-calculator/\">Stopnja potenja</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/climb-time-calculator/\">Čas vzpona</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/gear-speed-calculator/\">Prestave in hitrost</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/tools/swim-pace-calculator/\">Tempo plavanja (CSS)</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Deli svoje vožnje</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ponosen na trening? Deli ga na Instagramu in nas označi, radi vidimo tvoje delo.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Odpri <b>aplikacijo Vekta</b> in tapni trening, ki si ga opravil.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Tapni <b>Deli</b> (zgoraj desno) in izberi <b>Instagram</b>.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Označi <b>@cigalacycling</b> v zgodbi ali objavi. Najboljše bomo delili.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeyoyBDI1Rl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Poglej, kako deluje (video Vekta)</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cigalacycling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vredno branja</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Novo na blogu (v angleščini)</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:shortcode -->[cc_latest_posts lang=\"en\"]<!-- /wp:shortcode --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Trening (v angleščini)</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/zone-2-training/\">The power of Zone 2 training</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/critical-power/\">Critical Power</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/w-prime/\">What is W Prime?</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/critical-power-testing/\">Critical Power testing: how to get reliable data</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/strength-training-for-cyclists/\">Strength training for cyclists</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/calibrate-a-power-meter/\">How to calibrate a power meter</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prehrana (v angleščini)</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/carbs-per-hour-endurance-fueling/\">How many carbs per hour?</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/cycling-nutrition-what-to-eat-and-drink-on-the-bike/\">What to eat and drink on the bike</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/hydration-tips/\">Hydration tips</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/why-do-you-bonk-on-the-bike/\">Avoid bonking on the bike</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Regeneracija (v angleščini)</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/how-to-maximse-your-recovery/\">How to maximise your recovery</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/fatigue-after-exercise-endurance-athletes/\">Why am I so tired after exercise?</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/heart-rate-variability-hrv/\">Heart rate variability (HRV)</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Teden tekme (v angleščini)</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/tapering/\">Tapering</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/the-importance-of-potentiation-in-warm-ups/\">Potentiation in warm-ups</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/tips-for-not-getting-dropped-cigala-cycling-coaching/\">Tips for not getting dropped</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/blog/tips-for-gravel-racing/\">Tips for gravel racing</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->"}